    {
      "id": "TS3004a.sys.s.8",
      "text": "The group decided to set the selling price of the remote control at about twenty-five Euros, and to target a profit of fifty million Euros by targeting a large European market, and the remote control must be original, trendy, and user-friendly.",
      "type": "decisions",
      "reference": [
        {
